# koma-studio
===
 Koma Studio is a local desktop creation tool designed for producing AI-generated comics-style videos, short dramas, and episodic video content. It integrates scriptwriting, character and scene creation, storyboarding, image and video generation, speech synthesis, timeline editing, and final export into a single workspace.
